# A4 – Ventilation Verification Tool for Building #2601

**Group 16 · Analyst · Indoor Climate**

## About the tool

This tool automates the room-by-room ventilation check defined in A2 for building #2601. 
It uses IfcOpenShell to read data from a local IFC model and checks wether the design supply airflow meets 
the calculated minimum for each room in scope.






